<title>AUSTRALIA: Moody's confirms AAA rating on PUMA's latest issue.</title>
<headline>Moody's confirms AAA rating on PUMA's latest issue.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1997-06-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Moody's Investors Service said on Friday that it had confirmed the AAA rating on the Puma Masterfund P-6 senior bonds following the issuance of an additional A$473 million of mortgage backed securities.</p>
<p>PUMA is the securitisation arm of Macquarie Bank Ltd. PUMA said on June 3 that it had issued a four tranche domestic bond issue with pricing due on or before June 6.</p>
<p>-- Sydney Newsroom 61-2 9373-1800</p>
